(text "Open E-stop / low PERMIT / external KILL / undervoltage / overcurrent clears immediately.\nRestore conditions then pulse ARM: no automatic restart. FPGA must drop PERMIT on watchdog/stall.\nHC08/HC74 are CMOS parts running at 3.3V. Do not substitute 74LS parts." (at 18 278 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left)) (uuid "19626417-4452-533c-8b29-389f92ecc290"))
